      {
       "id": "PR_kwDOR0TnfM8AAAABPNmfJA",
       "number": 74,
       "title": "fly: size machines per region, two per region",
       "body": "- drops the `[[vm]]` pin from the production config, so a deploy keeps each machine's size (otherwise the next deploy resets every machine to shared-cpu-1x)\n- `soft_limit` 1000 -> 3000 on :443, since the bigger machines hold up to ~2,000 bridges each\n- docs/server.md: two machines per region, sized per region (cdg/fra/lhr shared-cpu-4x, nrt/sin/sjc/gru/iad/ord shared-cpu-2x, syd/jnb shared-cpu-1x)",
